D)"},{"url":"https://data.dong-chinese.com/img/sinica/%F0%A5%B9%BA_14.png","source":"academia-sinica","description":"繹山碑(篆)秦","type":"Seal","era":"Qin dynasty (221-206 BC)"},{"url":"https://data.dong-chinese.com/img/sinica/%F0%A5%B9%BA_15.png","source":"academia-sinica","description":"睡.日甲59背(隸)秦","type":"Clerical","era":"Qin dynasty (221-206 BC)"},{"url":"https://data.dong-chinese.com/img/sinica/%F0%A5%B9%BA_16.png","source":"academia-sinica","description":"老子乙前125下(隸)西漢","type":"Clerical","era":"Western Han dynasty (202 BC-9 AD)"},{"url":"https://data.dong-chinese.com/img/sinica/%F0%A5%B9%BA_17.png","source":"academia-sinica","description":"河東鼎(隸)西漢","type":"Clerical","era":"Western Han dynasty (202 BC-9 AD)"},{"url":"https://data.dong-chinese.com/img/sinica/%F0%A5%B9%BA_18.png","source":"academia-sinica","description":"昭臺官扁(隸)西漢","type":"Clerical","era":"Western Han dynasty (202 BC-9 AD)"},{"url":"https://data.dong-chinese.com/img/sinica/%F0%A5%B9%BA_19.png","source":"academia-sinica","description":"華山廟碑(隸)東漢","type":"Clerical","era":"Eastern Han dynasty (25-220 AD)"},{"url":"https://data.dong-chinese.com/img/sinica/%F0%A5%B9%BA_20.png","source":"academia-sinica","description":"鮮于璜碑(隸)東漢","type":"Clerical","era":"Eastern Han dynasty (25-220 AD)"},{"url":"https://data.dong-chinese.com/img/sinica/%F0%A5%B9%BA_21.png","source":"academia-sinica","description":"千甓亭.楊紹買地瓦莂(隸)西晉","type":"Clerical","era":"Western Jin dynasty (266-316 AD)"}],"shuowen":"《說文》：“穅，穀皮也。从禾，从米，庚聲。康，穅或省。”","comments":[{"source":"academia-sinica","text":"李富孫辨字正俗：“穅、康本一字。穅从禾、米，康省从米。今以穅為穀皮字，而以康為康樂，康寧字，畫然分為二義。”郭沫若《甲骨文字研究》：“从庚之字有康字，小篆作𥹺，从米，云糠之省。穅曰：‘穀之皮。’然古文康字不从米……意亦絕無穅義……康字訓安樂，訓和靜，訓廣大，訓空虛，只空虛之義於穀皮稍可牽及，其他均大相逕庭，無由引伸。余意此康字必以和樂為其本義，故殷、周帝王即以其字為名號。穅乃後起字，蓋从禾康聲，古人同音通用不必康即穅也……康字蓋从庚，庚亦聲也。”"}],"variants":[{"char":"穅","parts":"禾康","source":"academia-sinica"},{"char":"康","parts":"广隶","source":"academia-sinica"}]},{"_id":"5f523b00de54193ed873b3b1","char":"𥹻","codepoint":"U+25E7B","strokeCount":13,"sources":["unicod